cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "OncoAgent: agentic decision support for oncologists"
abstract: "A clinician-only workspace in which nine agents read a lung cancer case, grade genomic evidence, check interactions, match recruiting trials and calculate doses; a language model writes a cited tumour-board pre-read, a deterministic safety-critic checks every claim, and the oncologist approves, modifies or rejects each recommendation into a hash-chained audit log. Research prototype with fictional patients."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Team DatourX"
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-20
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/shahriyar9507/oncoagent"
url: "https://oncoagent.vercel.app"
keywords:
  - oncology
  - clinical decision support
  - agentic AI
  - Model Context Protocol
  - non-small-cell lung cancer
  - human-in-the-loop
